  "details": "Would love to see an option added to invert the hand-tracking movement control, as well as a separate option to invert the hand-tracking rotation control.  This would make it feel more natural for me personally.\n\nAn invert hand-tracking movement option would make it so, when I pinch my left thumb and middle finger together, dragging forward would push the world away from me and move me backwards instead of pulling me forward.  Same with an option to invert rotation - when I pinch my right thumb and middle finger together, the proposed option would make dragging right rotate me to the left instead of the default behavior where it rotates me to the right.",
